# RULE 25 — AUDIT COVERAGE SINGLE SOURCE (2026-08-02)

Read `docs/audit/AUDIT-COVERAGE-LIVE.md` before ANY block.

Build ONLY rows where Verdict=FAIL and Status=OPEN in your lane.
On merge, set that row's Status=`FIXED (PR #N)` and Block/PR=`#N`.

This file is the single source of truth for audit findings — ignore stale per-module audit copies on Desktop / AUDITOR-RUN.

Column ownership (never edit another role's columns):
- CASCADE: Module, Layer, Entity, Verdict, Evidence, Date, Auditor (APPENDS new rows only)
- CODER/CURSOR: Status, Block/PR only (Status=`FIXED (PR #N)` when fixed in your lane)
- GUARD: Status → VERIFIED / REOPENED only

Never delete a row. Supersede = add a new dated row; mark old Status=SUPERSEDED.
A row with no Evidence is not a finding — it does not count.
Never work a defect that is not a FAIL+OPEN row on this file; never skip a FAIL that is.
`git pull --ff-only origin main` before editing AUDIT-COVERAGE-LIVE.md. Small docs-only commit + push.
